Winter sales in France? 🛍️🇫🇷 Say THIS

• les soldes = the sales
• en solde = on sale
• essayer = to try on
• la cabine = the fitting room
• moins cinquante pour cent = fifty percent off

💬 Your turn: Je cherche ___ en solde !

